   :reading "scheduled-observer:19 is a self-certification in the exact shape no-self-certification rules on: every firing writes a green row, so the trace manufactures the appearance of operation, and the verdict R10-equals-pass moves on evidence the apparatus made."
   :why-not "The grounds already reach there. scheduled-observer:9 carries @how aif/grounded-actuation-not-reobservation, attested by claude-15, and grounded-actuation:9 carries an AUTHORED @why to no-self-certification. A direct edge adds a second path to the same place without adding a claim."}]

